	(text "Proposal. Not built, not validated on hardware.\nJ3 takes a REGULATED 5 V source only. No USB cable on the Pi while J3 is powered.\nSpec: pipboy-hat/spec/SPEC.md. Header map: spec/pins.yaml.\nCross-sheet nets use global labels: I2C_SDA, I2C_SCL, ID_SD, ID_SC, SPI_SCLK, SPI_MOSI,\nSPI_MISO, TFT_CS, TFT_DC, TFT_RESET, TFT_BL, BTN_*, DIAL_A, DIAL_B, DIAL_PUSH,\nAUDIO_PWM, UART_TX, UART_RX. Rails use power symbols: +3V3, +5V, GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
